{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/guidance/help-with-self-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return","content_id":"cd783802-dd67-4512-8d86-097575296435","description":"Find information on completing the self-employment section of your Self Assessment tax return.\r\n\r\n","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>If you’re self-employed, your business will have various running costs. You can deduct some of these costs to work out your taxable profit as long as they’re <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/expenses-if-youre-self-employed\">allowable expenses</a>. You will need to add up all your allowable expenses for the tax year and put the total amount on your Self Assessment tax return.</p>\n\n<p>You can <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/simpler-income-tax-cash-basis/income-and-expenses-under-cash-basis\">use cash basis to work out your income and expenses</a> for your Self Assessment tax return, if you’re a sole trader or partnership without corporate partners.</p>\n\n<p>You do not need to send in proof of expenses when you submit your tax return. But you should keep proof and records so you can show them to <abbr title=\"HM Revenue and Customs\">HMRC</abbr> if asked.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return\">Helpsheets for filling in your tax return</h2>\n\n<p>Helpsheets provide information which can help you complete certain sections of your Self Assessment tax return. For example, checking if you qualify for a certain relief and working out figures you might need to include in your return.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"more-than-one-business\">More than one business</h3>\n\n<p>Find information about your tax return if you have <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/more-than-one-business-hs220-self-assessment-helpsheet\">more than one business (HS220)</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"agricultural\">Agricultural</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>check <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/farmers-and-market-gardeners-hs224-self-assessment-helpsheet\">reliefs and rules for farmers and market gardeners (HS224)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>find out about <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/farm-stock-valuation-hs232-self-assessment-helpsheet\">farm stock valuation (HS232)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"other-occupation-or-role-specific\">Other occupation or role specific</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/doctors-expenses-hs231-self-assessment-helpsheet\">calculating doctors’ expenses (HS231)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/averaging-for-creators-of-literary-or-artistic-works-hs234-self-assessment-helpsheet\">averaging tax relief for authors or artists (HS234)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/qualifying-care-relief-foster-carers-adult-placement-carers-kinship-carers-and-staying-put-carers-hs236-self-assessment-helpsheet\">qualifying care relief for carers (HS236)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"other-self-employment-helpsheets\">Other self-employment helpsheets</h3>\n\n<p>Read helpsheets about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/limit-on-income-tax-reliefs-hs204-self-assessment-helpsheet\">limit on Income Tax reliefs (HS204)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/how-to-calculate-your-taxable-profits-hs222-self-assessment-helpsheet\">calculating your taxable profits (HS222)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>claiming <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/losses-hs227-self-assessment-helpsheet\">relief for trading losses (HS227)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/information-from-your-accounts-hs229-self-assessment-helpsheet\">information from your accounts (HS229)</a></p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/capital-allowances-and-balancing-charges-hs252-self-assessment-helpsheet\">capital allowances and balancing charges (HS252)</a></p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"hmrc-youtube-videos\">\n<abbr title=\"HM Revenue and Customs\">HMRC</abbr> YouTube videos</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"youtube-playlist-on-self-employment\">YouTube playlist on self-employment</h3>\n\n<p>Watch a collection of <abbr title=\"HM Revenue and Customs\">HMRC</abbr> videos to <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8EcnheDt1zhBFuWSc1A-9VOsA3BIZXhL\">find out more about self-employment</a> and to help you understand and complete the self-employment section of your tax return.</p>\n\n<p>You will learn about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>getting help with basis period reform</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>basic record keeping</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>cash basis and simplified expenses</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>what expenses you can include on your tax return</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>claiming motoring expenses</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>what self-employed expenses are allowable for business premises</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>other allowable business expenses</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Class 2 National Insurance contributions</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"recorded-webinar-on-self-employment\">Recorded webinar on self-employment</h3>\n\n<p>Watch a recorded webinar about the self-employment section of your online tax return.</p>\n\n<p><a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zLfUkXKKjOE\">The self-employment section of your online tax return</a></p>\n\n<p>You will learn about:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>business and turnover</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>expenses</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>capital allowances and balancing charges</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>losses</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>tax deducted and Class 4 National Insurance contributions</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"The webinar about filling in the self-employment section of your tax return has been updated with the latest version.","public_timestamp":"2025-09-11T11:16:09Z"},{"note":"Added translation","public_timestamp":"2025-05-27T23:00:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["6667cce2-e809-4e21-ae09-cb0bdc1ddda3"],"first_public_at":"2025-05-28T00:00:00.000+01:00","headers":[{"headers":[{"id":"more-than-one-business","level":3,"text":"More than one business"},{"id":"agricultural","level":3,"text":"Agricultural"},{"id":"other-occupation-or-role-specific","level":3,"text":"Other occupation or role specific"},{"id":"other-self-employment-helpsheets","level":3,"text":"Other self-employment helpsheets"}],"id":"helpsheets-for-filling-in-your-tax-return","level":2,"text":"Helpsheets for filling in your tax return"},{"headers":[{"id":"youtube-playlist-on-self-employment","level":3,"text":"YouTube playlist on self-employment"},{"id":"recorded-webinar-on-self-employment","level":3,"text":"Recorded webinar on self-employment"}],"id":"hmrc-youtube-videos","level":2,"text":"HMRC YouTube videos"}],"political":false,"related_mainstream_content":[],"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"detailed_guide","first_published_at":"2025-05-28T00:00:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/guidance/help-with-self-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/guidance/help-with-self-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","base_path":"/guidance/help-with-self-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","content_id":"cd783802-dd67-4512-8d86-097575296435","document_type":"detailed_guide","links":{},"locale":"cy","public_updated_at":"2025-09-11T11:16:09Z","schema_name":"detailed_guide","title":"Help gyda hunangyflogaeth ar eich Ffurflen Dreth Hunanasesiad","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/guidance/help-with-self-employment-on-your-self-assessment-tax-return.cy","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/c